        "description": "# Catastrophe has struck the prehistoric world.\n\nAs a new cadet of the time-traveling Paleoguard, your mission is to raise baby dinosaurs into powerful adults with thriving herds, while restoring their habitats.\n\n**What some of XR's top Content Creators are saying about Dino Hab:**\n\n- Featured in Nathie's Top 25 Best Mixed Reality Games on Meta Quest 3 and 3S list. \"The game has a super addictive progression system\" - Nathie\n- \"A cozy family-friendly game that feels like a mix of exploring, learning and just spending time with adorable dinosaurs.\" - Cas and Chary XR\n- \"This dinosaur game is unreal!\" \"It's an educational game as well as being super fun and cute\" - OtterWorldly\n\n\n{1338223984221286}\n\n**Nurture Your Dinosaurs**\n\nRaise baby dinosaurs from hatchlings to towering adults.\n\n{556128130600558}\n\n**Manage Habitats**\n\nBuild evolving habitats for your dinosaurs while adapting to challenges like storms and volcanic eruptions\n\n\n{477140771581246}\n\n**Unlock Rewards and New Ecosystems**\n\nYour progress will earn you rewards and unlock new habitats. 3 full habitats are included with their own dinosaurs, climate, flora, fauna, fungi, and more.\n\n{2544933682564116}\n\n\n",
